# Optional Pipeline process environment
#
# Pipeline does not load this file. Codex, Claude, and AGY member labels come
# from checked-in project MCP adapters, not environment variables; they are not
# identity attestation. Each worktree uses its native Git index; do not set
# GIT_INDEX_FILE here. Keep secrets in desktop-app private configuration.

# GitHub Actions sets CI automatically. Local runners may uncomment it only when
# they intentionally need CI-mode output.
# CI=1
